{"created": "2026-08-17T04:46:08.694544+00:00", "modified": "2026-08-17T04:46:08.975236+00:00", "id": 21973224, "conceptrecid": "21154655", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21973224", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.21154655", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21973224", "metadata": {"title": "Linearized Certificates and Normality-Gated Registrations for Weighted Generator Averages", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21973224", "publication_date": "2026-08-17", "description": "<p>This paper studies weighted generator averages while separating linearized commutativity geometry, normality-gated spectral admission, and typed direct-support registration. The full complex-real commutator Jacobian at the canonical Rubik point has numerical rank 11 and nullity 7. After adjoining the linearized normality equations, the combined derivative has numerical rank 14 and nullity 4.</p>\n<p>Version 2.1 freezes the singular-value rank policy and refreshes the corresponding numerical certificates. It requires commutativity, Hermiticity, normality, and projector checks before a sample can enter the pointwise registration ledger. Four declared records are admitted. A single-quarter-turn perturbation is rejected before projector construction, and its post-admission sector and support fields remain uncomputed rather than being represented as zero.</p>\n<p>At the canonical point, the admitted joint decomposition has 9 sectors and typed support counts 438 and 408. Each tested inverse-pair-symmetric quarter-turn axis sample at weight 1.1 has 15 sectors, represented-operator direct-support count 1006, and finite-order-logarithm Lie-registration count 832. These are pointwise Computational Observations relative to the declared numerical policy.</p>\n<p>The revision does not establish a nonlinear commutativity chart, coherent projector continuation, a moving-wall theorem, routed or full-word depth, commutator support, or Lie depth. Linearized nullity is not promoted to the dimension of a smooth nonlinear solution manifold.</p>\n<p>Source repository:&nbsp;<a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https://github.com/dooven-prime/rime-lite\" rel=\"noopener\">https://github.com/dooven-prime/rime-lite</a></p>\n<p>Paper VI of the <strong>Representation-Induced Mechanics and Evolution (RIME)&nbsp;</strong>program.</p>\n<p>Independent researcher; no institutional affiliation.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Chen, WuJun", "affiliation": null, "orcid": "0009-0007-9561-2892"}], "keywords": ["generator-set moduli space", "RIME program", "Rubik cube representation", "commutativity locus", "matrix normality", "normal spectral charts", "joint spectral decomposition", "full-matrix Jacobian", "linearized constraints", "typed operator support", "Lie support", "weighted generator averages", "computational representation theory"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.21972335", "relation": "references", "resource_type": "publication-preprint", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.21583070", "relation": "references", "resource_type": "publication-preprint", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.21634007", "relation": "references", "resource_type": "publication-preprint", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "https://github.com/dooven-prime/rime-lite", "relation": "isSupplementedBy", "resource_type": "software", "scheme": "url"}], "dates": [{"type": "issued", "description": "Version 1 public release of Paper VI."}], "version": "2.1", "resource_type": {"title": "Preprint", "type": "publication", "subtype": "preprint"}, "alternate_identifiers": [{"identifier": "https://github.com/dooven-prime/rime-lite"}], "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 2, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "21154655"}}]}}, "title": "Linearized Certificates and Normality-Gated Registrations for Weighted Generator Averages", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21973224", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21973224", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21973224?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21973224", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21973224", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.21973224", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21973224/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21154655", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21154655", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21154655", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.21154655", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21973224/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21973224/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21973224/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21973224/media-files", "thumbnails": {"10": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21973224:paper6_arxiv.pdf/full/%5E10,/0/default.jpg", "50": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21973224:paper6_arxiv.pdf/full/%5E50,/0/default.jpg", "100": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21973224:paper6_arxiv.pdf/full/%5E100,/0/default.jpg", "250": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21973224:paper6_arxiv.pdf/full/%5E250,/0/default.jpg", "750": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21973224:paper6_arxiv.pdf/full/%5E750,/0/default.jpg", "1200": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:21973224:paper6_arxiv.pdf/full/%5E1200,/0/default.jpg"}, "archive": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21973224/files-archive", "archive_media": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21973224/media-files-archive", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21973224/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21973224/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21973224/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21973224/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21973224/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21973224/access/gr